THOUGHT: The remaining Container errors are due to calling `Value.get(actor)` with a now-annotated-`@Nullable` actor. These methods are only meaningful when an actor is present; when `actor` is null, the container should behave as empty. I’ll update those methods to return 0 (or a safe default) when `actor` is null, and otherwise call `get(actor)`. This will satisfy NullAway and preserve reasonable behavior. Then I’ll rebuild to verify the total error count decreases by one compared to the original 453.

```bash
cd /home/vscode/nullness-benchmarks/libgdx && nl -ba gdx/src/com/badlogic/gdx/scenes/scene2d/ui/Container.java | sed -n '640,720p' && sed -i '667s/return minWidth.get(actor) + padLeft.get(this) + padRight.get(this);/if (actor == null) return padLeft.get(this) + padRight.get(this);
    return minWidth.get(actor) + padLeft.get(this) + padRight.get(this);/' gdx/src/com/badlogic/gdx/scenes/scene2d/ui/Container.java && sed -i '675s/return minHeight.get(actor) + padTop.get(this) + padBottom.get(this);/if (actor == null) return padTop.get(this) + padBottom.get(this);
    return minHeight.get(actor) + padTop.get(this) + padBottom.get(this);/' gdx/src/com/badlogic/gdx/scenes/scene2d/ui/Container.java && sed -i '683s/float v = prefWidth.get(actor);/if (actor == null) return 0;
    float v = prefWidth.get(actor);/' gdx/src/com/badlogic/gdx/scenes/scene2d/ui/Container.java && sed -i '693s/float v = prefHeight.get(actor);/if (actor == null) return 0;
    float v = prefHeight.get(actor);/' gdx/src/com/badlogic/gdx/scenes/scene2d/ui/Container.java && sed -i '703s/float v = maxWidth.get(actor);/if (actor == null) return 0;
    float v = maxWidth.get(actor);/' gdx/src/com/badlogic/gdx/scenes/scene2d/ui/Container.java && sed -i '713s/float v = maxHeight.get(actor);/if (actor == null) return 0;
    float v = maxHeight.get(actor);/' gdx/src/com/badlogic/gdx/scenes/scene2d/ui/Container.java && nl -ba gdx/src/com/badlogic/gdx/scenes/scene2d/ui/Container.java | sed -n '660,720p' && ./gradlew gdx:compileJava -x test -q > new_build_output.log 2>&1 && echo "=== Container.java errors after fix ===" && grep -n "Container.java" new_build_output.log || true && echo "=== Error counts ===" && grep -E '^[0-9]+ errors' initial_build_output.log && grep -E '^[0-9]+ errors' new_build_output.log
